    "content": {
      "rendered": "\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_1909292643\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<h1></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"></h1>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n<style>\n#section_1909292643 {\n  padding-top: 30px;\n  padding-bottom: 30px;\n}\n</style>\n\t</section>\n\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-840086380\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-295711188\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<h2> </h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-1642 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/erecycling_logo_only.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"272\" height=\"275\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/erecycling_logo_only.png 642w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/erecycling_logo_only-297x300.png 297w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 272px) 100vw, 272px\" /></h2>\n<h3>Both <strong><a href=\"http://www.strategicitpro.com/\">Strategic IT</a></strong> and <a href=\"http://www.getlagosnow.com/\"><strong>Get Lagos Now</strong> </a>come together yearly to host an the <strong>E-Recycling PDX Event</strong> with sponsoring companies and organizations, with the purpose of fulfilling a core passion – to help give back to those in need through quality electronic donations.</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.72px;\"> Event link details below and highlights of our first years of donating in 2020 -2026</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">                                           </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/18etapEVH3Y\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3366\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/you-tube.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/you-tube.jpg 225w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/you-tube-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" /></a></p>\n<h3>Below is our QR Codes, both Paypal and Venmo for  donations. Thank you! Please remember the $5.00 coffee amount you send our way are the cost of new cords and supplies we need to get these electronics refurbished and given back out to <a href=\"https://newavenues.org/\">New Avenues for Youth</a>, <a href=\"https://blanchethouse.org/\">Blanchet House</a>, <a href=\"https://www.raphaelhouse.org/\">Raphael House</a> and <a href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\">Rosehaven.</a>  Thank you!</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3163\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/venmo-ERecyclingpdx.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"423\" height=\"640\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/venmo-ERecyclingpdx.jpg 423w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/venmo-ERecyclingpdx-198x300.jpg 198w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 423px) 100vw, 423px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-3159 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/QR-Code-for-E-Recycling.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"209\" height=\"209\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/QR-Code-for-E-Recycling.png 320w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/QR-Code-for-E-Recycling-300x300.png 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/QR-Code-for-E-Recycling-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 209px) 100vw, 209px\" /></p>\n<h3> </h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://strategicitpro.com/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1515 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/compass.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"182\" height=\"142\" /></a><a href=\"http://www.getlagosnow.com/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-1514 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/gln-300x76.png\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/gln-300x76.png 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/gln.png 330w\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"76\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Donations Questions – Contact Michelle at <a href=\"mailto:Michelle@GetLagosNow.com\">Michelle@GetLagosNow.com</a></strong></p>\n<h2> </h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #808080;\">2020 &#8211; 2026 Donations</span></strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 130%; color: #808080;\"><strong>First Annual Event</strong> &#8211; We&#8217;re happy to announce that over 72 items were donated and 35 items were refurbished and donated in 2020/2021.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Donation Highlights &#8211; Tablet Donations</span> &#8211;  <span style=\"color: #99cc00;\"> <a style=\"color: #99cc00;\" href=\"https://raphaelhouse.com/\">Raphael House</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2026 alignleft\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Michelle-donates-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"433\" height=\"578\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Michelle-donates-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Michelle-donates-225x300.jpg 225w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Michelle-donates-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Michelle-donates.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 433px) 100vw, 433px\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2027\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/gary-donates-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"438\" height=\"584\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/gary-donates-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/gary-donates-225x300.jpg 225w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/gary-donates-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/gary-donates.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 438px) 100vw, 438px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #339966;\">January 2021 Cellphone Donations</span> to<span style=\"color: #808000;\"> <a style=\"color: #808000;\" href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\">Rose Haven</a></span> &#8211; <span style=\"color: #808080;\">Executive Director Katie O&#8217;Brien</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-2029 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Gary-and-Michelle-donate-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Gary-and-Michelle-donate-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Gary-and-Michelle-donate-300x225.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Gary-and-Michelle-donate-768x576.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Gary-and-Michelle-donate-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Gary-and-Michelle-donate-400x300.jpg 400w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Gary-and-Michelle-donate.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%; color: #808080;\"><strong>New Avenues for Youth &#8211; Executive Director, Sean Suib</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1770 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/NAFY.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/NAFY.jpg 640w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/NAFY-300x225.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/NAFY-400x300.jpg 400w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1774\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/NAFY-sign-1024x410.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"658\" height=\"263\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/NAFY-sign-1024x410.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/NAFY-sign-300x120.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/NAFY-sign-768x308.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/NAFY-sign.jpg 1141w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 658px) 100vw, 658px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%; color: #808080;\"><strong>Rose Haven</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1771 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RH2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RH2.jpg 640w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RH2-300x225.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RH2-400x300.jpg 400w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%; color: #808080;\"><strong>Rose Haven &#8211; Executive Director, Katie O&#8217;Brien</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1773\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RH1-rotated.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"640\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RH1-rotated.jpg 480w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RH1-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1772 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RH3-rotated.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"640\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RH3-rotated.jpg 480w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RH3-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%; color: #808080;\"><strong>Rosewood Initiative</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1776 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RW3-rotated.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"640\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RW3-rotated.jpg 480w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RW3-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1775\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RW1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"272\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RW1.jpg 640w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RW1-300x128.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%; color: #808080;\"><strong>Rosewood Initiative &#8211; Partnerships and Operations Director, Marissa Clarke</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1778 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Rosewood-meeting-.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Rosewood-meeting-.jpg 640w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Rosewood-meeting--300x225.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Rosewood-meeting--400x300.jpg 400w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1777\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RW2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"576\" height=\"640\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RW2.jpg 576w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RW2-270x300.jpg 270w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\"> </span></strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>1st Annual E-Recycling Event</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 120%;\"><span style=\"color: #808080;\"><strong>Thank you! </strong></span><strong> &#8211; <span style=\"color: #808000;\"><a style=\"color: #808000;\" href=\"http://www.patrizia.photography/\">http://www.patrizia.photography!</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-1644 alignleft\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/GLN-at-work.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"454\" height=\"302\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/GLN-at-work.jpeg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/GLN-at-work-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/GLN-at-work-768x511.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 454px) 100vw, 454px\" />      <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1647\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Laughing-in-the-mask.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"458\" height=\"304\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Laughing-in-the-mask.jpeg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Laughing-in-the-mask-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Laughing-in-the-mask-768x511.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 458px) 100vw, 458px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1645\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/gary-computer-1-681x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"429\" height=\"645\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/gary-computer-1-681x1024.jpeg 681w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/gary-computer-1-200x300.jpeg 200w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/gary-computer-1-768x1154.jpeg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/gary-computer-1-1022x1536.jpeg 1022w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/gary-computer-1.jpeg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 429px) 100vw, 429px\" />      <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1648\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/carina-bakery-681x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"430\" height=\"647\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/carina-bakery-681x1024.jpeg 681w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/carina-bakery-200x300.jpeg 200w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/carina-bakery-768x1154.jpeg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/carina-bakery-1022x1536.jpeg 1022w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/carina-bakery.jpeg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 430px) 100vw, 430px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">         <im